  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An object undergoes simple harmonic motion with frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span>. The graph shows the variation of its acceleration with displacement.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the value of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f^{2}\"></span> in s<sup>−2</sup>?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{5}{\\pi^{2}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{5}{\\pi}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{100}{\\pi^{2}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{100}{\\pi}\"></span></li></ol>"
